==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|mánuðr}}, variant of {{m|non|mánaðr}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*mēnōþs||month}}, from a derivative of {{inh|is|ine-pro|*mḗh₁n̥s||moon, month}}. See also {{m|is|máni}}. Cognate with {{cog|fo|mánaður}}, Danish and Norwegian Bokmål {{m|da|måned}} and Swedish and Norwegian Nynorsk {{m|sv|månad}}, English {{m|en|month}}, Old English {{m|ang|mōnaþ}}, German {{m|de|Monat}}, Dutch {{m|nl|maand}}.

